      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Essence is green copper at rank one, red iron at rank two, white silver at rank three, yellow gold at rank four, and purple crystal at rank five.",
      "chapters": [
        475
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "How primeval essence works across ranks is covered on that page and on aperture and primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_primeval_essence",
        "sys_aperture_and_primeval_essence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yellow gold primeval essence at rank four has better quality than white silver primeval essence. It nurtures the aperture more strongly.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "quality-above-white-silver",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nine eyes liquor worm at rank four can purify yellow gold primeval essence by a small realm, matching how lower-rank liquor worms step green copper, red steel, and white silver essence. Using that worm at rank four initial stage yields yellow gold middle stage primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liquor-worm-purification",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Initial stage yellow gold essence appears as light gold primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        331
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stages-inside-rank-four",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nine eyes liquor worm can raise that quality by one small realm into bright golden primeval essence, also called bright gold primeval essence, which cleanses aperture walls and aids battle.",
      "chapters": [
        344
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stages-inside-rank-four",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Upper stage within rank four is essence gold primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        358
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stages-inside-rank-four",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peak stage is true gold primeval essence; the next great step after that peak store is rank five initial stage light purple primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        424
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stages-inside-rank-four",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rank three tier is covered on white silver primeval essence. The rank five tier is covered on purple crystal primeval essence.",
